    "product": {
      "id": 14660519821677,
      "title": "Stay All Day® Chroma-Flash Liquid Eye Liner",
      "handle": "stay-all-day-chroma-flash-liquid-eye-liner",
      "vendor": "Stila Cosmetics",
      "product_type": "Blush",
      "body_html": "<p>These liquid eye liners hit a whole new eye dimension with a stunning shade-shifting formula. Richly pigmented with chameleon-like pearls and a metallic chrome finish for colors that play out right before your eyes. Bold and brilliant for a flash of drama and transforming hues that hit different at every angle. Choose from three multi-shade/multi-hued experiences.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vivid color-shifting effects last all day.</li>\n<li>Long-wearing and resistant to smudging, flaking, and fading.</li>\n<li>Glides on effortlessly for smooth, skip-free application. Allow time to dry and set.</li>\n<li>Pro-precision brush lets you create perfect lines and eye effects.</li>\n<li>Lightweight and comfortable wear. </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Clinical Test Results:  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>97%* said eye liner feels lightweight and is comfortable to wear.</li>\n<li>94%* said the easy-glide applicator makes application effortless.</li>\n<li>94%* said the color shift with the formula is easy to see and pleasant.</li>\n<li>91%* said eye liner made eyes looks brighter and vibrant. NEW</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Based on a survey of 35 subjects.</p>\n<p>0.04 fl. oz./1.2 mL</p>\n<p>CAUTION: In case of irritation or discomfort, discontinue use.</p>",
