      "handle": "blush-bronze-hydro-blur-cheek-duo",
      "vendor": "Stila Cosmetics",
      "product_type": "Eye Liner",
      "body_html": "<p><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong></strong></span>Dual-ended and double-duty essential for color, contour, and bronzing perfection. <br></p>\n<p>This peak of cheek essential delivers color, contouring and bronzing in one dual-ended stick. A creamy-gel formula formulated with Stila’s Hydro-Blur Blend creates a dewy, glassy skin look and a seamless finish.  Sheer, buildable and versatile for blush and define perfection.</p>\n<p>CLINICAL TEST RESULTS: *<br>97% said it helps define and add color. <br>97% said it is easy to apply and to blend with fingertips. <br>94% said it blends seamlessly into skin.<br>94% said it doesn't look heavy or cakey. <br>94% said it feels lightweight on skin.<br>94% said it doesn't leave a sticky after-feel. <br>94% said it gives skin a healthy glow. <br>90% said it provides a seamless radiant color and delivers a touch of sun-kissed radiance. <br>90% said it doesn't look streaky and patchy. <br><br>*Based on a clinical &amp; consumer panel study of 32 subjects.</p>\n<p>0.33 oz</p>\n",
