      "vendor": "FLOWER Beauty",
      "product_type": "Lip Color",
      "body_html": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Plump Up Gloss Stick is an all-in-one gloss-balm hybrid that nourishes, hydrates, and comfortably plumps lips while delivering buildable color with a dewy, shinny finish. The ultra-cushiony formula melts onto lips, providing a tingle-free, visibly plumped effect. An infusion of hyaluronic acid, castor oil, &amp; vitamin E condition and moisturize lips, helping to visibly smooth the look of lines.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">• Comfortably Plumps Lips</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">• Sweet Vanilla Scented</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">• Cruelty Free</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">• Vegan</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">• Gluten Free </div>",
